OL,3,GNEWSACosmetic crackdown should be sped 
OL,4,Aup says charity                        
OL,6,FThe director of a safer cosmetics      
OL,7,Fcharity has called for the government  
OL,8,Fto speed up a crackdown on so-called   
OL,9,F"cosmetic cowboys".                    
OL,11,FAlice Webb, a mother-of-five from      
OL,12,FWotton-under-Edge, collapsed and died  
OL,13,Ffollowing a liquid Brazilian butt lift 
OL,14,F(BBL) procedure in September 2024,     
OL,16,FAt the end of her inquest on Friday, a 
OL,17,Fjury concluded her death was accidental
OL,18,Fbut the coroner ruled there were       
OL,19,F"significant risks" of future deaths   
OL,20,Fand plans to send a report to the      
OL,21,Fgovernment.                            
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
