OL,3,GNEWSACosmetic crackdown should be sped 
OL,4,Aup says charity                        
OL,6,FAshton Collins, director of Save Face, 
OL,7,Fsaid she shared the disappointment of  
OL,8,FWebb's family in the verdict, adding:  
OL,9,F"With every day that passes, there is a
OL,10,Fstrong likelihood there will be another
OL,11,Fdeath linked to these procedures."     
